#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:201
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: MongoDB's shadow system is unique in that the "
"primary elevation shadow uses `rgba(0, 30, 43, 0.12)` — a teal-tinted "
"shadow that carries the forest-dark brand color into the depth system. "
"This means even on white surfaces, shadows feel like they belong to the "
"MongoDB color world rather than being generic neutral black."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:203
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:205
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:206
msgid "Use `#001e2b` (forest-black) for dark sections — not pure black"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:207
msgid "Apply MongoDB Green (`#00ed64`) sparingly for maximum electric impact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:208
msgid ""
"Use MongoDB Value Serif ONLY for hero/display headings — Euclid Circular "
"A for everything else"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:209
msgid ""
"Apply Source Code Pro uppercase with wide tracking (1px–3px) for "
"technical labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:210
msgid "Use teal-tinted shadows (`rgba(0,30,43,0.12)`) for primary card elevation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:211
msgid "Maintain the dark/light section duality — dramatic contrast between modes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:212
msgid "Use weight 300 for body text — the light weight is the readable voice"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:213
msgid "Apply pill radius (100px) to primary action buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:215
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:216
msgid ""
"Don't use pure black (`#000000`) for dark backgrounds — always use teal-"
"black (`#001e2b`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:217
msgid ""
"Don't use MongoDB Green (`#00ed64`) on backgrounds — it's an accent for "
"text, underlines, and small highlights"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:218
msgid ""
"Don't use standard gray shadows — always use teal-tinted "
"(`rgba(0,30,43,...)`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:219
msgid "Don't apply serif font to body text — MongoDB Value Serif is hero-only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:220
msgid ""
"Don't use narrow letter-spacing on Source Code Pro labels — the wide "
"tracking IS the identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:221
msgid "Don't mix dark and light section treatments within the same section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:222
msgid "Don't use warm colors — the palette is strictly cool (teal, green, blue)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mongodb.md:223
msgid ""
"Don't forget the green accent underlines — they're the signature "
"decorative element"
msgstr ""

